# LF everywhere, on every checkout. Git for Windows defaults to core.autocrlf=true,
# which turns the commit hook's `\` line continuations into syntax errors and breaks
# every frontmatter parser in tools/ and hooks/ (they key on "---\n"). The parsers also
# normalise CRLF on read, for clones made before this file existed.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.woff2 binary
